<title>SWEDEN: ICE HOCKEY-SWEDEN BEAT FINLAND IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>ICE HOCKEY-SWEDEN BEAT FINLAND IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden beat Finland 7-4 (0-1 5-0</p>
<p>2-3) in an ice hockey friendly on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Sweden - Per Eklund (23), Magnus Svensson (29, Jorgen</p>
<p>Jonsson (31), Michael Nylander (35, Niklas Sundblad (37, 41),</p>
<p>Magnus Arvedsson (50).</p>
<p>Finland - Mika Nieminen (19, 40, 52), Juha Riihijarvi (54).</p>
<p>Attendance: 9,441.</p>
</text>
